# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — dengue_ctmc_spark_turkiye
# =============================================================================

# ── R session / history ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.RDataTmp
.RDataTmp*
*.RData.bak

# ── renv: keep renv.lock and the activate script, ignore the local library ────
renv/library/
renv/local/
renv/cellar/
renv/staging/
renv/python/
renv/sandbox/

# ── Raw climate data — NOT redistributed (size + licensing) ───────────────────
# Retrieve via the Copernicus CDS queries documented in data_raw/README_data.md
# (S1 Data: raw CMIP6 and ERA5-Land NetCDF are not redistributed)
*.nc
*.nc4
*.grib
*.grb

# ── knitr / R Markdown render caches ──────────────────────────────────────────
*_files/
*_cache/
**/figure-html/
**/figure-latex/

# ── Ad-hoc "new folder" and backup directories — do not track ─────────────────
Yeni klasör/
**/Yeni klasör/
eski_v3_yedek/
**/eski_v3_yedek/

# ── Optional: rep1 single-draw sweep outputs (keep the rep1000 outputs) ───────
# Uncomment to slim the repository; rep1000 files are the reproducible ones.
# outputs/**/*_rep1.csv
# outputs/**/*_rep1.rds

# ── OS / editor junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
desktop.ini
bulgular.html
